First successful rauc install and slot switch on hardware, 2026-10-29. Board flashed with
4ae0c69 (slot A), bundle 40a54ec fetched into /data over the static address, SHA-256
1be834f0d8ebe717709b3080d5133fe25466f4629798da9bd3ea69f9f3ae70a6 on both ends. Console capture
by the user; the bracketed prefix of the original is the capturing terminal's clock (UTC+7).

EXCERPT. Omitted, nothing else edited: the ~55 repeated "NN% Copying image to rootfs.1" progress
lines between 46% and 99%, and the kernel and driver messages of the reboot between 0.000 s and 8 s.

